an sparige VI Pro 1</sense>
          <sense n="2"><hi rend="italic">zur Verallgemeinerung, praesent. <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:oder"><abbr>od</abbr></ref>. futur. Sinnes;</hi> swilce hordera swylc gewita wære, beo <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 3,2; dyde (<hi rend="italic">möge er tun</hi>) dæda þe dyde, þæt wræce <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI</ref> 7</sense>
          <sense n="3"><hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:vergleiche"><abbr>vgl</abbr></ref>. Plusquampf. <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Nummer"><abbr>n.</abbr></ref></hi> 3; <hi rend="italic">Praesens <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Nummer"><abbr>n.</abbr></ref></hi> 2 <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:folgende"><abbr>f.</abbr></ref></hi></sense>
